  <item>
    <title>看世界 | 泉州古韵解压疗愈；川西探索神秘之地</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/650d52265c88d241268f12c7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">650d52265c88d241268f12c7</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Sep 2023 08:36:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎您来坐下聊会儿看世界栏目~ 这是一期温暖治愈的节目。院长的声音很有松弛感，请听她娓娓道来，带我们到泉州，感受这座全城申遗城市的半城烟火半城仙；去川西，体验神秘高原的魅力，骑马、转山、观天zang。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">00:01:55</a>:探索泉州，了解它的文化和历史</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="699">00:11:39</a>:泉州的老街，充满仙气</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1095">00:18:15</a>:一碗花生汤，治愈焦虑</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1595">00:26:35</a>:高反缓解方法：深呼吸和喝可乐</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1991">00:33:11</a>:四姑娘山：美丽的山，背后的故事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2204">00:36:44</a>:探索色达，神秘之地</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2439">00:40:39</a>:一场关于天zang的冒险之旅</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2922">00:48:42</a>:川西实用旅行攻略</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3108">00:51:48</a>:我骑着马儿哒哒哒～(almost)脱缰啦</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3588">00:59:48</a>:香格里拉与稻城亚丁</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3988">01:06:28</a>:牛奶海与五色海</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4125">01:08:45</a>:藏民婚礼的亲身经历</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4364">01:12:44</a>:川西美食</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4794">01:19:54</a>:川西旅途有趣故事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5000">01:23:20</a>:小县城就医的愉快体验</span></p><span></span><p><span>【院长旅途摄影欣赏】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkJ91BBEhpf33O4aUD-IY5dNgang.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp81OaCYvQlAyxI11TUZn4au-108.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlrRi35hKnibIdRtoNc8gzXX12Af.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fog1I0abZZaDtIZcJvAPV5zeRXmp.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtXf5evJDnnpbd6oH-bsOo5k2FA7.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FslvXrj1-e7ysoliGWOn8MvtTdRN.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgDC7QWn8g4aN1-115yP7T6_8wu8.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp63pVf_OXDzV-FSjOb5o57aCfqk.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsNmZ2ShZSv1xOrn4OLa4ywB7Uwq.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp7gUeTHD0xt3bHh5bMrzt-aunje.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【本期制作组】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：院长 | 小黄 | Silence</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑制作：Silence</span></p><span></span><p><span>小助手微信：chilltalking</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家多多评论分享~ 您的反馈是我们录制更新的动力哦</span></p>]]></description>
